      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        129.8181915283203,
        515.7351684570312,
        144.2611846923828
      ],
      "text": "scope (including PICO and background questions), the rationale, objectives and target",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        143.01820373535156,
        237.45150756835938,
        157.46119689941406
      ],
      "text": "audience for the guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.47319793701172,
        161.77740478515625,
        515.7601318359375,
        176.3303985595703
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 2  includes WHO recommendations on TB screening and contact investigation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.73619842529297,
        163.48239135742188,
        102.47319793701172,
        175.69239807128906
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        175.08753967285156,
        515.8524780273438,
        189.53053283691406
      ],
      "text": "that are relevant to children and adolescents. While no new recommendations were made",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979230880737305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        188.28749084472656,
        515.7769165039062,
        202.73048400878906
      ],
      "text": "in these areas by the GDG on the management of TB in children and adolescents, new",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        201.48744201660156,
        515.7650146484375,
        215.93043518066406
      ],
      "text": "recommendations on TB screening in children and adolescents were issued by WHO in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        214.68739318847656,
        515.708740234375,
        229.13038635253906
      ],
      "text": "2021. These include recommendations on the populations to be screened (persons living",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        227.8874053955078,
        515.7704467773438,
        242.3303985595703
      ],
      "text": "with HIV infection and close contacts) and the screening tools that can be applied. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        241.08753967285156,
        429.5957946777344,
        255.53053283691406
      ],
      "text": "other recommendations in this chapter relate to contact investigation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.47319793701172,
        259.84674072265625,
        515.8458251953125,
        274.3997497558594
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 3  focuses on TB prevention. It includes existing recommendations on TB infection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.996748924255371,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.73619842529297,
        261.5517272949219,
        102.47319793701172,
        273.7617492675781
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        273.15667724609375,
        515.489501953125,
        287.5997009277344
      ],
      "text": "prevention and control as well as TPT. The recommendations on TPT relate to the identification",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        286.356689453125,
        515.7515258789062,
        300.7997131347656
      ],
      "text": "of populations who should be tested for TB infection, algorithms to rule out TB disease,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        299.55682373046875,
        515.73291015625,
        313.9998474121094
      ],
      "text": "tests for TB infection and TPT regimens. This chapter also includes recommendations on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        312.7567138671875,
        438.0488586425781,
        327.1997375488281
      ],
      "text": "BCG vaccination that were published in a WHO position paper in 2018.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.47319793701172,
        331.5160217285156,
        515.6930541992188,
        346.06903076171875
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 4  includes WHO recommendations on diagnostic approaches. Two new",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.73619842529297,
        333.22100830078125,
        102.47319793701172,
        345.4310302734375
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        344.8260192871094,
        515.590087890625,
        359.26904296875
      ],
      "text": "recommendations were made in the 2021 GDG meeting on: (i) the use of Xpert Ultra",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        358.0260009765625,
        515.91455078125,
        372.4690246582031
      ],
      "text": "in gastric aspirate and stool specimens to diagnose pulmonary TB and rifampicin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        371.22601318359375,
        515.742919921875,
        385.6690368652344
      ],
      "text": "resistance; and (ii) the use of integrated treatment decision algorithms in children with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        384.4259948730469,
        515.5604858398438,
        398.8690185546875
      ],
      "text": "presumptive pulmonary TB. Other recommendations in this chapter include existing WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.974771499633789,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        397.6260070800781,
        515.7264404296875,
        412.06903076171875
      ],
      "text": "recommendations on rapid diagnostic tests including Xpert MTB/RIF, Xpert Ultra, Truenat",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        410.8260192871094,
        512.7112426757812,
        425.26904296875
      ],
      "text": "MTB, MTB Plus and Truenat MTB-RIF Dx, lateral flow urine lipoarabinomannan (LF-LAM)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        424.0260009765625,
        515.7616577148438,
        438.4690246582031
      ],
      "text": "assays, low complexity automated nucleic acid amplification tests, line probe assays and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        437.22601318359375,
        457.27557373046875,
        451.6690368652344
      ],
      "text": "high complexity reverse hybridization-based nucleic acid amplification tests.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.47319793701172,
        455.9853210449219,
        515.6146240234375,
        470.538330078125
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 5  focuses on TB treatment. Four new recommendations were made by the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.73619842529297,
        457.6903076171875,
        102.47319793701172,
        469.90032958984375
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        469.2953186035156,
        515.7627563476562,
        483.73834228515625
      ],
      "text": "child and adolescent TB GDG on TB treatment: (i) a 4-month regimen for children and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        482.49530029296875,
        515.5577392578125,
        496.9383239746094
      ],
      "text": "adolescents 3 months to 16 years of age with non-severe drug-susceptible TB; (ii) a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        495.6953125,
        515.8970336914062,
        510.1383361816406
      ],
      "text": "6-month intensive regimen to treat TB meningitis composed of isoniazid, rifampicin,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        508.895263671875,
        515.8080444335938,
        523.3382568359375
      ],
      "text": "pyrazinamide and ethionamide; (iii) use of bedaquiline as part of shorter or longer",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        522.0953369140625,
        515.74609375,
        536.538330078125
      ],
      "text": "regimens for children of all ages to treat MDR/RR-TB; and (iv) use of delamanid as part",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        535.2952880859375,
        515.9044799804688,
        549.73828125
      ],
      "text": "of longer regimens for children of all ages to treat MDR/RR-TB. A summary of other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        548.4953002929688,
        515.7616577148438,
        562.9382934570312
      ],
      "text": "valid treatment recommendations is also consolidated in this chapter, including for drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        561.6953125,
        352.3876037597656,
        576.1383056640625
      ],
      "text": "susceptible and DR-TB and for severe forms of EPTB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.47319793701172,
        580.45458984375,
        515.6312255859375,
        595.007568359375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 6  includes WHO recommendations on models of care. Two new recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.73619842529297,
        582.1596069335938,
        102.47319793701172,
        594.3695678710938
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57869720458984,
        593.7645874023438,
        515.7396850585938,
        608.2075805664062
      ],
      "text": "on models of care arose in 2021 including one on decentralized care and another on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57879638671875,
        606.964599609375,
        515.8615112304688,
        621.4075927734375
      ],
      "text": "integrated family-centred care. Other WHO recommendations in this chapter include",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57879638671875,
        620.1646118164062,
        515.7405395507812,
        634.6076049804688
      ],
      "text": "existing recommendations on health education and counselling, treatment adherence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57879638671875,
        633.3646240234375,
        499.74346923828125,
        647.8076171875
      ],
      "text": "interventions, treatment support and decentralized care for people with MDR/RR-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.47319793701172,
        652.1239013671875,
        515.7428588867188,
        666.6768798828125
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 7  includes existing WHO recommendations on several specific situations such",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.73619842529297,
        653.8289184570312,
        102.47319793701172,
        666.0388793945312
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57879638671875,
        665.4338989257812,
        515.714599609375,
        679.8768920898438
      ],
      "text": "as care of the child or adolescent living with TB and HIV, care of children with TB and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57879638671875,
        678.6339111328125,
        515.848388671875,
        693.076904296875
      ],
      "text": "malnutrition, and optimal feeding of infants born to mothers with TB. The recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57879638671875,
        691.8339233398438,
        515.7193603515625,
        706.2769165039062
      ],
      "text": "on HIV include those on HIV testing, eligibility for and timing of antiretroviral therapy (ART),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.959927558898926,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57879638671875,
        705.033935546875,
        388.7732849121094,
        719.4769287109375
      ],
      "text": "co-trimoxazole prophylaxis and treatment regimens for ART.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.47319793701172,
        723.793212890625,
        515.737060546875,
        738.34619140625
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 8  describes research priorities that were identified at the GDG meeting in 2021.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.73619842529297,
        725.4982299804688,
        102.47319793701172,
        737.7081909179688
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57879638671875,
        737.1032104492188,
        515.8081665039062,
        751.5462036132812
      ],
      "text": "These signal areas where additional evidence is needed to improve the prevention,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.57879638671875,
        750.30322265625,
        374.2972717285156,
        764.7462158203125
      ],
      "text": "management and care of TB in children and adolescents.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
